version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-18"  # bump on every tagged release
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChelseaKR/wildfire-service-territory-overlap"
abstract: >-
  A measurement of how much of California's public wildfire damage-inspection record set
  can be attributed to a published electric service territory boundary, and how much
  cannot. Every published rate carries its denominator and a confidence interval, and no
  utility is ranked or compared. Unofficial and not affiliated with any agency or utility.
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - California
  - electric service territory
  - damage inspection
  - CAL FIRE DINS
  - California Energy Commission
  - point-in-polygon
